SUMMARY:CANCELED MO Girls 2017/2018 West Ham - BONUS TECH TRAINING & FREE PLAY - AT THE WOODS (St. Charles)
DESCRIPTION:TECH TRAINING IS INDIVIDUAL PLAYER DEVELOPMENT IN AGE GROUP SETTING.  <br><br>Improve your touch\, creativity\, and technique! ‬  Tech Training is individual-based player development training in an age-group setting.  There is no cost for this training session.<br><br>This is a BONUS TECH Training from 2 PM to 3 PM at our new facility in St. Charles (The Woods).  <br><br>NEW FACILITY: THE WOODS - ST. LOUIS SCOTT GALLAGHER - The Woods – St. Louis Scott Gallagher (formerly Vetta Woodlands) expands SLSG’s training footprint and reflects the club’s long-term commitment to player development across the St. Louis region. Located in Cottleville\, MO - The Woods provides critical space to support SLSG’s continued growth and year-round programming.  <br><br>2 Woodlands Pkwy\, Cottleville\, MO 63376.<br><br>Activities after the TECH TRAINING:<br><br>3 PM to 4 PM - BREAK (Easter Egg Hunt for the littles)<br><br>4 PM to 5 PM - 4v4 FREE PLAY (U6 to U14)<br><br>The facility includes:<br><br>Four (4) full-size 11v11 outdoor grass fields (planned turf conversion)<br>One (1) indoor turf field<br>On-site building with bar and concession space<br>Administrative offices to support daily operations<br><br>With both indoor and outdoor fields\, The Woods offers flexible\, all-season training and match opportunities for players at every level. As development plans progress\, additional facility improvements will continue to enhance the experience for SLSG players and families.<br><br>MORE ON TECH TRAINING:<br>- A technical training program for all SLSG Players.<br>- Sign-up is by individual player\; it is not a team event.  RSVP on this Playmetrics event<br>- U6 to U14 age groups<br>- Boys and Girls<br>- 6 sessions on Saturday mornings.  The Bonus Session at The Woods will make 7 sessions total. <br>- The times vary by facility (double check the schedule on link below) <br>- Weather-related cancellations will be posted on Twitter (X) - @SLSGfacilities<br>- There is no cost for SLSG players\, but all players need please to RSVP on this Playmetrics event.<br>- There are off weeks in the middle of the program due to SLSG Tournaments\, double check schedule.<br><br>AGE GROUPS:<br>U6\, U7\, U8\, U9\, U10\, U11\, U12\, U13\, U14\, <br>(all at 2 PM to 3 PM for TECH TRAINING at SLSG\, The Woods)<br><br>FULL TECH TRAINING SCHEDULE:<br>https://bit.ly/SLSG-trainingprograms-26spring<br><br>ITEMS TO NOTE:<br>In order to staff the session correctly\, we ask all players to RSVP on this Playmetrics event<br>The cost is included in club dues. There are no make ups due to facility plans.<br>Weather related cancellations will be posted on twitter - @SLSGfacilities and if we we are able\, emailed through the sign-up list (we are sometimes in the field and can not).
LOCATION:2 Woodlands Pkwy\, Cottleville\, MO 63376\, USA
STATUS:CANCELLED
URL:https://playmetrics.com
X-CODEX-SOURCE:playmetrics-soccer
END:VEVENT
